    "detailed_description": "<h1>Follow Us</h1><p>Don't want to miss the latest news of Breeze? Follow us here:<br>Youtube: <br>Instagram: <br>Twitter: <br>Weibo: <br>bilibili: </p><br><h1>Looking forward to your feedback</h1><p>After you have played our game, we look forward to getting your feedback in the comment section or in the Google Form below.<br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081460/extras/30d9bc1668ebd64d64b7bc9e021fc11e.webp?t=1663507796\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081460/extras/6a52704ada985f9b397e4e3e79d0dad1.avif?t=1663507796\" /></div><br>Far away, at the foot of the snowy mountains, there is a village called Ereb. There is a rumor about this village, it says, &quot;devouring everything, there is no return&quot;.<br><br>A sugar glider detective ignores the advice and goes to the Ereb Village alone. In addition, to finding the truth, she is looking forward to getting someone's clues. <br><br>Ask the villagers, get clues and get closer to the truth. But before that, why are all the villagers falling asleep?<br><br>Let's find a way to wake up the villagers first. The detective launches a search in Ereb Village.<br><br>Short branch, looks like it'll work. Little windmill, why are the blades loose\uff1f Does the round sun blink its eyes just now?<br><br>As the villagers wake up, the truth about Ereb Village comes to light. At the same time, the detective's own memory is gradually awakened...<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081460/extras/1033b5da3fce2d0229ec3769c09ba6cc.webp?t=1663507796\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081460/extras/861cc33ead6212f972ca24fa4885100b.avif?t=1663507796\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081460/extras/8957f41c16d19d7805fc5ec59c0e5c37.avif?t=1663507796\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081460/extras/e20100674ca4295d19e2e7f5908b9b86.avif?t=1663507796\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081460/extras/fa5cdea3447e436b29f86bb680106410.avif?t=1663507796\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081460/extras/b828011a9ec399705e06c5d2f90ad639.avif?t=1663507796\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081460/extras/6fd1756cdd03cd369fe3b43bd27bb861.avif?t=1663507796\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081460/extras/cc43070c4da195e8365724eabe6dcaa9.webp?t=1663507796\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About Mouse</h2>During the game, when you see the mouse cursor change from an &quot;<strong>arrow</strong>&quot; to a &quot;<strong>paw</strong>&quot;, the area that is currently pointing at is interactive! You can click on this area to pick up items, talk to characters, or get information about the environment.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081460/extras/fae1d7b4a8dcfb43255d50f604d25421.poster.avif?t=1663507796\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081460/extras/fae1d7b4a8dcfb43255d50f604d25421.webm?t=1663507796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081460/extras/fae1d7b4a8dcfb43255d50f604d25421.mp4?t=1663507796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About Inventory</h2>The inventory has a fantastic &quot;<strong>combination</strong>&quot; function. Enjoy combining item with environment, item with item, item with character.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081460/extras/dc70a1f1cf4abc76e4b4efd15aff0ee7.poster.avif?t=1663507796\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081460/extras/dc70a1f1cf4abc76e4b4efd15aff0ee7.webm?t=1663507796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081460/extras/dc70a1f1cf4abc76e4b4efd15aff0ee7.mp4?t=1663507796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About Magic Magnifying Glass</h2>Inside the inventory, the <strong>magic magnifying glass</strong> is placed in the lower right corner of each item. Click on the magnifying glass to <strong>get more details</strong> about this item.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081460/extras/4ff9238e6679970ea1a6a4a0191356a7.poster.avif?t=1663507796\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081460/extras/4ff9238e6679970ea1a6a4a0191356a7.webm?t=1663507796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081460/extras/4ff9238e6679970ea1a6a4a0191356a7.mp4?t=1663507796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About Detail Page</h2>When the mouse is <strong>hovering</strong> over the item, more <strong>information</strong> about this item will be displayed. Some items contain interesting <strong>puzzles</strong>, so make sure you interact with them on the <strong>detail page</strong>.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081460/extras/dc70a1f1cf4abc76e4b4efd15aff0ee7.poster.avif?t=1663507796\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081460/extras/dc70a1f1cf4abc76e4b4efd15aff0ee7.webm?t=1663507796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081460/extras/dc70a1f1cf4abc76e4b4efd15aff0ee7.mp4?t=1663507796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
