    "reviews": "\u201cThis game is fantastic, I highly recommend others to play it. The art is beautiful as well as the music, and the characters are adorable. The gameplay is also fun and challenging, the inspection ability and being able to interact with the items I have is very clever. My favorite parts are the owl explaining things to you and the dialogue, especially when talking to the duck.\u201d<br />\r\nneo<br />\r\n",
